{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/c2919723404a444354aed78826d9f037.webp?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Tinkerlands - a colorful and magical, yet dangerous survival adventure where players </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are stranded on mysterious islands. Craft, build, explore, and survive, alone or with friends online! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/71d0cdbcc6a627fa28f6eb3e083f659a.webp?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/899d930a1509965c160e8e0ea99ed960.poster.avif?t=1755258920\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/899d930a1509965c160e8e0ea99ed960.webm?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/899d930a1509965c160e8e0ea99ed960.mp4?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast main island, three major islands (with more coming during Early Access), and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >numerous smaller islands - each offering unique challenges, events, loot, and adventures! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/55ac68da1dbb1ca7ab433a052816992f.webp?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/3505576121100cf8e8dc82aea8c1a6b7.poster.avif?t=1755258920\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/3505576121100cf8e8dc82aea8c1a6b7.webm?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/3505576121100cf8e8dc82aea8c1a6b7.mp4?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own settlement, invite diverse NPCs to open shops, offer unique quests and helpful </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hints to aid your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/151b1cd0f2af8a045d91111402e4da7f.webp?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/c4e2548c55e7d6fc770eb2d87064dc6c.poster.avif?t=1755258920\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/c4e2548c55e7d6fc770eb2d87064dc6c.webm?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/c4e2548c55e7d6fc770eb2d87064dc6c.mp4?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and craft resources from the islands\u2019 environments and defeat over 10 challenging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bosses to create powerful weapons - or quirky items just for fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/19bff03557b351fd245ac8ef61d0bf9f.webp?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/37d8fa1f919af8d0bca7e11c8a724a37.poster.avif?t=1755258920\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/37d8fa1f919af8d0bca7e11c8a724a37.webm?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/37d8fa1f919af8d0bca7e11c8a724a37.mp4?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing, farming, cooking or setting up a deadly monster arena with cables and traps - fun and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >relaxing activities that complement your adventurous island life, offering variety and charm to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/1da77bbfe7c8af151f3c152464cdfc94.webp?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/fc77e80ecad36cde3f7db1f7dda823ac.poster.avif?t=1755258920\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/fc77e80ecad36cde3f7db1f7dda823ac.webm?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/fc77e80ecad36cde3f7db1f7dda823ac.mp4?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your crew (up to 4 players online) and tackle the islands\u2019 many challenges together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your settlement, sail the seas, and create memorable moments!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Tinkerlands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2617700/c29bcf836c8754b9bb0a686fb80c8202f48249d7.jpg"},{"name":"Deep Down Low","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2617700/df387d32f77eb4977a8a7d4535ce9a64146124ba.jpg"},{"name":"Arachnophobian't","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2617700/5aaf75d7acf375c6b1024ce8e3a2d44060374bb3.jpg"},{"name":"Croak and Dagger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2617700/b3dd4ed6ab896adbb4edae92d9e44d057013bbb8.jpg"},{"name":"Heart Container","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2617700/a58621b4d921bc5df628844ea5782a8960724685.jpg"},{"name":"Stardrop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2617700/a020cb34fee337ff6cf9a719a63af1017c3ce79d.jpg"},{"name":"Town Meeting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2617700/7b705385ab719d825a0444860688b22337158dca.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2617700/5dc4dd0de1deb6f0ebba7569e8e8f8d38b14c01d.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Item","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2617700/0b6caff96914f13356a81edef9ca999843a866bf.jpg"},{"name":"Fungus Among Us","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2617700/900d7a1b8a03389445470a0af271cbb0cbf71ee6.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2617700?t=1755258920","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755258920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/96b596c2da9bcdcc511a916f3238135f44c5004a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755258920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/96b596c2da9bcdcc511a916f3238135f44c5004a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755258920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3185760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/6dafb7a168a4a926f19c671cab862fce.avif?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=1080 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/c2919723404a444354aed78826d9f037.webp?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Tinkerlands - a colorful and magical, yet dangerous survival adventure where players </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are stranded on mysterious islands. Craft, build, explore, and survive, alone or with friends online! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/71d0cdbcc6a627fa28f6eb3e083f659a.webp?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/899d930a1509965c160e8e0ea99ed960.poster.avif?t=1755258920\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/899d930a1509965c160e8e0ea99ed960.webm?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/899d930a1509965c160e8e0ea99ed960.mp4?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast main island, three major islands (with more coming during Early Access), and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >numerous smaller islands - each offering unique challenges, events, loot, and adventures! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/55ac68da1dbb1ca7ab433a052816992f.webp?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/3505576121100cf8e8dc82aea8c1a6b7.poster.avif?t=1755258920\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/3505576121100cf8e8dc82aea8c1a6b7.webm?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/3505576121100cf8e8dc82aea8c1a6b7.mp4?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own settlement, invite diverse NPCs to open shops, offer unique quests and helpful </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hints to aid your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/151b1cd0f2af8a045d91111402e4da7f.webp?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/c4e2548c55e7d6fc770eb2d87064dc6c.poster.avif?t=1755258920\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/c4e2548c55e7d6fc770eb2d87064dc6c.webm?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/c4e2548c55e7d6fc770eb2d87064dc6c.mp4?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and craft resources from the islands\u2019 environments and defeat over 10 challenging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bosses to create powerful weapons - or quirky items just for fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/19bff03557b351fd245ac8ef61d0bf9f.webp?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/37d8fa1f919af8d0bca7e11c8a724a37.poster.avif?t=1755258920\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/37d8fa1f919af8d0bca7e11c8a724a37.webm?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/37d8fa1f919af8d0bca7e11c8a724a37.mp4?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing, farming, cooking or setting up a deadly monster arena with cables and traps - fun and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >relaxing activities that complement your adventurous island life, offering variety and charm to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/1da77bbfe7c8af151f3c152464cdfc94.webp?t=1755258920\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/fc77e80ecad36cde3f7db1f7dda823ac.poster.avif?t=1755258920\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/fc77e80ecad36cde3f7db1f7dda823ac.webm?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/extras/fc77e80ecad36cde3f7db1f7dda823ac.mp4?t=1755258920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your crew (up to 4 players online) and tackle the islands\u2019 many challenges together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your settlement, sail the seas, and create memorable moments!</p>","developers":["CodeManu","Endless Coffee"],"dlc":[3710880],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617700/d3c84c141c67e09a973663834465aa83bbbc9afc/header.jpg?t=1755258920","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257144204,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144204/movie480.mp4?t=1748015758","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144204/movie_max.mp4?t=1748015758"},"name":"Early Access gameplay trailer","thumbn